# The library's own party: the party screen, its notices and /zigparty, so a party works on a server running
# nothing else. The file name is the key PREFIX: an entry here resolves as ziggfreedcommon.party.<key>.
# The screen's words (its tabs, buttons, title, count, badge and empty lines) go on Labels' TextSpans, and they,
# the notices and the command lines fill their parameters in the viewer's locale.

